{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/367baa43e261e14d3900e0d98391959d.avif?t=1740261615\" width=600 height=112 /></span><br><br>The First Journey is just the beginning of a much grander experience (as the name sort of implies!). So, for now, familiarize yourself with the wasteland - you'll spend a lot more time in it when Outcast Tales is out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be tactical</strong> (or mash buttons;  might work just as well)!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5efa71c3c8b8e12d77d236f21476814d.poster.avif?t=1740261615\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5efa71c3c8b8e12d77d236f21476814d.webm?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5efa71c3c8b8e12d77d236f21476814d.mp4?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Robots, mutants, desert raiders: almost all enemies have something up their sleeve. So do your characters: some abilities are most effective in combination with others. Find your opponents' weaknesses, humiliate them on the battlefield, and never ponder the moral implications of your actions!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your strengths</strong> (if you can find any)!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/083011eabb4b0a648c370ba7e2fe0c1d.poster.avif?t=1740261615\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/083011eabb4b0a648c370ba7e2fe0c1d.webm?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/083011eabb4b0a648c370ba7e2fe0c1d.mp4?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combine class and personality types to give each of your characters a unique set of abilities. A Preacher Mercenary and an Antihero Mercenary will behave quite differently. Create a balanced crew, or just try out the wildest combinations to see how they turn out!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome challenges</strong> (or mess everything up)!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/ed0a6adad706a7c188eb03365d52fff5.poster.avif?t=1740261615\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/ed0a6adad706a7c188eb03365d52fff5.webm?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/ed0a6adad706a7c188eb03365d52fff5.mp4?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your characters will encounter dozens of unique situations that test their skill and wits. The Pacifist might talk his way out of trouble, the Egghead might try setting up traps, and the Daredevil will most likely just start blasting! In Outcast Tales, there are no wrong answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop relationships</strong> (like in a dating game, but not quite)!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5e1b34eff3beb0a1c36983ba5a9fd582.poster.avif?t=1740261615\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5e1b34eff3beb0a1c36983ba5a9fd582.webm?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/882590/extras/5e1b34eff3beb0a1c36983ba5a9fd582.mp4?t=1740261615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your characters can develop deep bonds or even fall in love - but can also come to despise each other, all depending on your actions. Your journey can become a wholesome story about newfound friendship, or a gruesome tale of three strangers constantly at each other\u2019s throats. Whatever sounds more fun\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let the chat join the action</strong> (or, more realistically, set you up)! </h2><br>Connect the game to your Twitch account so that your viewers can influence the gameplay! The Twitch Integration feature will enable your chat to make crucial decisions during events, as well as choose your next destination or ability upgrade. And don't worry, your viewers won't ever try to harm you. They love you. Right..?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7e684d358f99ab16e7578349712f64e3c0643e0e.jpg","localized_name":"Easy Money","name":"Easy Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/882590/7e684d358f99ab16e7578349712f64e3c0643e0e.jpg"},{"icon":"681d9da89f4f451ff22c897eba453f979a917885.jpg","localized_name":"More Like Almost-Villain, Really","name":"More Like Almost-Villain, Really","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/882590/681d9da89f4f451ff22c897eba453f979a917885.jpg"},{"icon":"0bac0359656342ed4ad802b94bd9167d22dd45b1.jpg","localized_name":"Overkill","name":"Overkill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/882590/0bac0359656342ed4ad802b94bd9167d22dd45b1.jpg"},{"icon":"d24729f50633b1de826ed62f2ffe656ba593537d.jpg","localized_name":"Untouchable","name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/882590/d24729f50633b1de826ed62f2ffe656ba593537d.jpg"},{"icon":"91a665e223d9e23a0a303a2acdace28a1498d84d.jpg","l